{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"f9596deb-53dd-4440-980c-1d4e0b0a7427","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the problem space. Q6.1 asks: \"芯片级设计方法（Chiplet、Wafer-Scale、PIM、DRAM/RERAM集成、NoC等）如何从硬件体系结构层面支持MoE、DiT、多模态、Video模型在单GPU/NPU/加速器上的多算子/微算子并发推理？各类设计范式的关键方法、设计决策与并发机制是什么？\"\n\nLet me now perform semantic decomposition and search. The key concepts from Q6.1:\n- Chiplet-based design\n- Wafer-Scale Integration\n- Processing-in-Memory (PIM)\n- DRAM/RERAM integration\n- Network-on-Chip (NoC)\n- Chip-level concurrency\n- Hardware architecture for ML inference\n- Multi-operator parallelism\n\nLet me decompose into logical chain nodes:\n\nS1: Chiplet-based design - chiplet architecture, die-to-die interconnect\nS2: Wafer-Scale Integration - Cerebras, Tesla Dojo  \nS3: PIM/DRAM/RERAM integration - near-memory computing\nS4: NoC - on-chip network, topology, routing\nS5: These paradigms supporting MoE/DiT/multimodal/Video models\nS6: Multi-operator/micro-operator concurrency mechanisms at chip level\n\nLet me now search across the four directories. I'll start with Level A (long match) searches in parallel.","signature":"f9596deb-53dd-4440-980c-1d4e0b0a7427"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":21133,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07af869c-596d-4d6e-a2f2-404ae7fe4d49","uuid":"2a1eb1e8-e592-4277-948b-a7a1ef6d4a56"}
