{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_01_cb7k1iknQwHmZhE0X2hR2871","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/2D Mesh NoC in 3D Near-Memory Processing.md\",\"basename\":\"2D Mesh NoC in 3D Near-Memory Processing\",\"score\":7855.30843008144,\"foundWords\":[\"noc\",\"network-on-chip\",\"mesh\",\"mesh/torus\",\"torus\",\"routing\",\"routing（先沿\",\"network\",\"on\",\"chip\",\"network-on-chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Mesh\",\"offset\":6},{\"match\":\"NoC\",\"offset\":11},{\"match\":\"mesh\",\"offset\":53},{\"match\":\"Network-on-Chip\",\"offset\":58},{\"match\":\"routing（先沿\",\"offset\":140},{\"match\":\"mesh\",\"offset\":195},{\"match\":\"NoC\",\"offset\":200},{\"match\":\"NoC\",\"offset\":278},{\"match\":\"NoC\",\"offset\":410},{\"match\":\"mesh\",\"offset\":440},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":530},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":602},{\"match\":\"mesh\",\"offset\":718},{\"match\":\"NoC\",\"offset\":723},{\"match\":\"Routing\",\"offset\":824},{\"match\":\"routing\",\"offset\":845},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":964},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1116},{\"match\":\"mesh\",\"offset\":1163},{\"match\":\"NoC\",\"offset\":1168},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1237},{\"match\":\"mesh/torus\",\"offset\":1370}],\"excerpt\":\"## 2D Mesh NoC in 3D Near-Memory Processing\\n术语解释\\n2D mesh Network-on-Chip 是 3D NMP 加速器中连接分布式计算节点的片上互联网络拓扑。每个节点通过路由器连接到其东、西、南、北四个邻居，数据包通过 XY routing（先沿 X 轴后沿 Y 轴）计算 Manhattan 最短路径进行传输。\\n术语是什么？\\n2D mesh NoC 是一种规则网格拓扑的片上网络，每个 tile（计算节点+内存 bank）位于网格交叉点上，通过双向链路连接相邻 tile。在 3D NMP 架构中，NoC 替代了 GPU 中的 shared memory…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Channel Dependency Graph (CDG) for Multi-Chiplet NoC _ 多芯粒NoC的通道依赖图.md\",\"basename\":\"Channel Dependency Graph (CDG) for Multi-Chiplet NoC _ 多芯粒NoC的通道依赖图\",\"score\":201.8073561342731,\"foundWords\":[\"network\",\"network-on-chip\",\"on\",\"chip\",\"chiplet-to-interposer\",\"chiplet-interposer-chiplet\",