{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"165e7d3c-01b7-497f-80d6-70a94ca30c62","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"答案文件已完成写入。以下是 Q6.1 的执行摘要：\n\n**Q6.1 — 芯片级设计方法如何从硬件体系结构层面支持多算子/微算子并发推理**\n\n**答案结构**（546 行，按\"硬件架构和运行时\"侧重组织）：\n\n### 方法细节（主内容）\n1. **Chiplet 范式**：MCM-GPU 架构 + Active Interposer + UCIe 标准化 + DFBM 跨芯粒死锁解决方案，含 4-Chiplet 系统 Mermaid 拓扑图\n2. **Wafer-Scale 范式**：Cerebras WSE-2 数据流架构 + Tesla Dojo/TSMC SoW 2D mesh + Two-Level CP（Global/Local）+ Multi-Die Task Allocation + Hardware-Managed HBM (ATU/PDU)，含 SoW 8×3 拓扑图和并发工作流伪代码\n3. **PIM 范式**：DRAM-based PIM (GDDR6-AiM 16-bank MAC 并发) + 3D NMP (Hybrid Bonding + 2D mesh NoC)，含芯片内部并发结构图和 token dispatch/combine 流程图\n4. **NoC 范式**：2D Mesh + XY Routing + Multi-VN/VC 隔离 + CDG 死锁分析理论，含并发通信模式 Mermaid 图\n5. **综合并发全景**：四种范式垂直叠加的完整数据流图 + 五层并发机制总览表\n\n### 实验环境（主内容）\n- 6 种模拟器/平台对比表（Python event-driven simulator、Gem5+Garnet、Ramulator 2.0 等）\n- 关键评估指标表（hop count 142×、throughput 6.3-7.5×、硬件开销 <0.04%）\n\n### 不确定性\n6 项证据不足标注（Wafer-scale 商用成熟度、PIM 大 batch 局限、RERAM 缺失、多模态/Video/DiT 直接证据不足、NPU 芯片设计缺失、NoC 拓扑定量对比缺失）\n\n**笔记证据**：18 条 vault 笔记引用，覆盖 paper_secs、knowledge_notes、experiment_notes 三个目录，所有证据标注 omnisearch 分数。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":80892,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07af869c-596d-4d6e-a2f2-404ae7fe4d49","uuid":"d9d0cf54-61ae-4123-9c46-9f76ea54f5ad"}
